fiber*).\n\nNet: your \"count-discard IS the generator\" is right in spirit, but the defect is measure-zero away from c=0.99 and concentrated entirely at the `min(0.99,·)` gate. That's exactly the localization result for 0009 — **the 2-cell obstruction lives on a single identifiable site: the confidence-ceiling fiber.**\n\nWant me to fold this into 0009's worked example — honest-`w` associativity vs the c=0.99 clip-break, with this exact triple as the canonical counterexample?")) 
